facts, Lemma 5.5.3 and Corollary
5.5.4, and the work Paper 085's
preliminaries rest on, its Schwartz
sections of tempered bundles
generalizing this work's Section 5.
The filing holds the cluster's
substrate at its source: the
Schwartz, tempered and generalized
sections of Nash bundles, the
restricted topology they live in,
the operators that test them,
extension by zero and the
characterization that makes it an
isomorphism, the tempered partition
of unity, extension from closed
submanifolds, the transversal
filtration of the supported
generalized sections — the cited
