its source: Casselman's theorem at a
minimal parabolic, the two canonical
globalizations, the minimal
comparison, the reduction between
the completions, the principal-series
reduction, and the unpublished
theorem's proof state in 1998. The
theory files as nine concepts
(1.2.1008-1.2.1016); no held concept
is revised. The filing is made on a
