theorem the comparison country was
founded spending. The filing holds
the theorem at its source: the
equivalence of categories, the
maximal and minimal globalizations
in the book's own forms, goodness,
the automatic continuity theorem,
moderate growth, the theorem's
nonlinear generality, and its
Plancherel chapter with the error
its author repaired himself. The
theory files as nine concepts
(1.2.1017-1.2.1025); no held concept
is revised. The filing is made on a
partial text — the author's own
exposition of the book's central
chapter, the book's printed record,
and its citing papers — the book's
