the degree-2 tilt that escapes
the linear cap. Twelve concepts
(1.2.1120-1.2.1131), no
foundation, five questions
(Q467-Q471), two machines; the
concept ledger reaches 1,131 —
the 1,120 line Restructuring
Pass #52 set is CROSSED at this
filing's first concept, and
Pass #53 stands due, not run by
this filing. Cluster BA is
founded — the book's first
communication-complexity country.

Hundred-and-twenty-second walk: a
Will-posted ingestion, no queue
rank — Venkatesa Chandrasekaran's
'An algebraic quantization of
gravity from the null cone', a
solo construction claiming a
background-independent
quantization of four-dimensional
vacuum gravity from null data:
the reduced phase space of
intersecting null cones; the
gravitational clock that counts
its states; the corner boost
charge that prices area; the
algebra of observables from
action deformations and its
type I factor; the absolutely
convergent Lorentzian path
integral and its finite pair
amplitude; the causal diamond's
finite dimension; the trace
entropy and Sen's coefficient
recovered at one loop; topology
as null states; and the
semiclassical Einstein equations.
Fourteen concepts
(1.2.1132-1.2.1145), no
foundation, six questions
(Q472-Q477), two machines; the
concept ledger reaches 1,145 —
the 1,140 line Restructuring
Pass #53 set is CROSSED at this
filing's ninth concept, and
Pass #54 stands due, not run by
this filing. Cluster BB is
founded — the book's first
quantum-gravity country.

Hundred-and-twenty-third walk: the
day's cron pick of the Thirst,
sealed blind before reading —
Soyeong Oh's 'Certifying a
Sufficient Gaussian Dependence
Regime for Learned Weighted FDR
Control' (arXiv:2611.33892v1),
filed on the full text held entire
from arXiv's HTML (v1, the only
version): a certificate, built
from reference data by an
intersection-union test of
correlation signs, that routes
between learned weighted BH at
full level and a discounted
Benjamini-Yekutieli fallback,
controlling FDR for every Gaussian
correlation matrix; the boundary
obstruction that makes uniform
certification impossible at zero
correlation; the matched minimax
price of certification, gamma^-2
log d; and certification scores
drawn from the testing subjects'
own residual contrasts. Ten
concepts (1.2.1146-1.2.1155), no
revision (the seal's one foretold
revision judged a phantom under
the revision rule), four questions
(Q478-Q481), two machines; the
concept ledger reaches 1,155 — the
1,160 line Restructuring Pass #54
set is NOT crossed, by five, and
no pass falls due. Cluster O is
extended on its own ground.

Hundred-and-twenty-fourth walk:
a Will-directed ingestion, filed
on the house's own full audit —
the solved-conjectures collection
of Cinna Davis and GPT-6.2 Astra,
180 claimed resolutions of named
conjectures in combinatorics and
number theory, each carrying a
written proof and a Lean-status
label, read under the house
standing that the Lean layer is
provisional: a declaration to
compare, never evidence. Eighteen
results at full three-column
depth — the source's statement,
the collection's statement, and
the evaluator's recomputation
agreeing — and 162 at doc depth;
one divergence at full
prominence, Graffiti.pc 318
proved in its complement variant
only, the conjecture as stated
open; two stale documentation
paragraphs; a repo-wide hygiene
verdict clean with its caveat
stated; the catalogue's one
external audit verified genuine.
Thirty-seven concepts
(1.2.1156-1.2.1192), no revision,
four questions (Q482-Q485), two
machines; the concept ledger
reaches 1,192 — the 1,160 line
Restructuring Pass #54 set is
CROSSED at the fifth concept, and
Pass #55 falls due. Cluster BC is
founded on its own ground.
