- Pass #24 (2026-11-24; Paper 037 filing; standing trigger — the 520-concept line set at Pass #23): all 522 canonical concepts reviewed. Merges: NONE — candidates weighed and held apart: 1.2.512 (the ten task categories) into 1.2.511 (the leveled research task) — HELD APART: category and level are orthogonal axes of the dataset (a task's kind of work against how widely it is shared); the site's filters and the work activities run on the categories alone. 1.2.519 (the RL feasibility index) and 1.2.520 (the AI-completion Elo) into 1.2.518 (the task dimensions) — HELD APART under the instrument rule: each is a separate instrument with its own construction (a principal component with released constants; a Bradley-Terry model over 95,040 judged comparisons), used apart from the dimension layer it draws on, and the work's own documentation treats both separately. 1.2.522 (the researcher census) into 1.2.509 (SciNet) — HELD APART: a distinct data product with its own method (an OpenAlex sample read by a model), released as its own file with its own error bars. Splits: NONE. Retired: NONE. Area claims checked on this pass's own counts: the standoff companions at 1.5.4 stand at 54; the machines tally stands at 192 held (163 stated, 29 inferred); foundations stand at 245, defined words at 117. Registry re-proved in Lean at this taking-in (registry accurate; total, unique and receipt-backed; every registry-to-structure condition proved). Action taken: cluster AS founded (addendum below); the pass is logged here. Next pass due at Paper 042 or 560 canonical concepts, or on overlap revealed by a delta.

