gradient; generation is not execution
understanding; correct but slow; the
unmeasured country of state over time; a
practitioner's four claims, filed as
testimony (AI spectacularly bad at complex
SQL; the reason standing in the
data model and the business logic; most humans
barely understand it either; untangling
legacy SQL is worth a fortune); Will's four,
filed as attributed (the suspicion that all
they need is phext; the mechanism of
downstream effects; time legible; the
NetHack binding); the program model; the
situation model; plans and beacons; tracing
the prerequisite; two ways to study before a
change; human SQL errors semantic and
persistent; the three-stage reading, with
its tension; the life of a query; the cost
question open; fork and read the delta. A
country this book had not entered: no
earlier cluster prices a working language
against living data, nor the learning of
reading itself. Nearest neighbours: AK (the
grammar country — AM's SQL is one language
read against data, not a family of
notations); P (reasoning through errors —
AM's taxonomies are counted failures of a
skill, not a logic of reasoning); O
(statistics and measurement — AM spends
benchmark measurements, but its ground is
the skill, not the measure); I
(specification as control — the test design
at 48.2.1 is a specification, spent there,
not the country's ground). Calls: the seed
claims call Cristina A.C.'s challenge and
Will's direction, recorded at 48.1.1; the
diagnosis calls the benchmark record of BIRD
and Spider 2.0; the human path calls the
comprehension literature of 1983-2019.
