alone, a table audited, a coding
set, a synthesis set, a table
whose key is worked, and the
union table of the whole
curriculum; this one is the pair
— a goal and two finished
solutions, exactly one correct,
over sixteen thousand training
pairs of everyday physical tasks.
What the tenth resident adds is
the paired examination (1.2.882),
the trick solution (1.2.883), the
adversarial filter (1.2.884),
reporting bias (1.2.885), the
matched surface (1.2.886), the
pivot word (1.2.887) and the
