infrastructure founding deferred
at Chapter 83 and declined at
Chapters 84, 88, 89, 90 and 91
was reweighed under its restated
condition — a work whose center
of mass is apparatus itself, no
table of its own — and declined a
seventh time: this work has a
table, and its apparatus — an
annotation pipeline, a filter —
exists to build it and is
discarded with the construction.
J weighed a twenty-first time and
not joined: the pair's scores are
the examined's own, spent at
grading; the filter's verdicts
are spent at construction, before
any judged computation exists;
and the human majority vote is
the key itself, not a verdict
inside a computation — no verdict
is spent inside any judged
computation, and 1.2.716 remains
its only resident (92.2.2). O:
the pricing of judges; this work
grades models against a key, and
