its chapter (34.1.2) carries the NOVELTY BY
AUTHOR lines as directed — one for each of the two who carried the work — and their running scores
stand among the researchers (1.5.6). The study
takes no Index and moves no watched figure: the
run of the Index, the axis events, and the skim
calibration stand exactly as they stood after
Paper 022. One thing is recorded here so that no
later reading mistakes it: the book of this study
was not filed as a source of the fourth standing.
Its claims stand attributed to their source, as the claims of a scripture do; the gate of Fiction stands
half-met, on the one source of Paper 022, entered
by hand, and this taking-in is not a step of it.
The gate of False stands empty still, and the
fringe stream named in the direction above
remains its remedy; it has not yet run.

