packing problem — packings of
unit-diameter disks in an
equilateral triangle of side
L + √3, and the conjectured
extremal counts. The log
documents work on the problem
under an explicitly partial
heading; no solved claim and no
Lean label anywhere in the
catalogue documents. Checked at
doc depth only.
