# Paper 019 — Provenance: author check (charter rule 15)

Author: Carlos Rito (one author), of the Centro de Matematica
da Universidade do Minho — Polo CMAT-UTAD, Universidade de
Tras-os-Montes e Alto Douro, Portugal. His own record, as the
web returns it: a worker in algebraic geometry whose research centres on
