singular Godeaux surfaces and of explicit fake quadrics. That
last is an adjacency worth naming plainly: the author's own
field touches the subject of cluster E of this tracker, the
fake quadrics of Paper 005, from the computational side. It is
an adjacency of field, not a tie to phext: nothing in it
connects the author to Will or to Will's work.

THE CHECK, run 2026-11-14 before integration. The full text of
arXiv:2611.14543 v1 was read entire, its references included:
no occurrence of phext, phextura, Exocortex, Mirrorborn,
