THE CENSUS. 175,187 Lean source files,
1,030,536,719 bytes uncompressed, and no
compiled objects shipped — a source artifact,
to be built by whoever would check it. Its
pins: Lean v4.33.1 (lean-toolchain), mathlib
at revision
0df444a360eaa60ab8c11dca51a86af692955474
(lakefile.toml). The tree's shape stands at
