build Main at 18:36 CST on 2026-11-20,
mathlib's compiled form from the project's
cache at the pinned revision. At the making
of this filing the build stands at 490
compiled modules of 175,136, its compiler
processes running clean; at the observed rate
the run measures in days. The filing is
therefore made with the build as a named,
