(1.1.4) as bookkeeping.

RESEARCH ORACLE: the FALSE gate moves, and
the estimate with it. Through 1,204 entries
and 32 papers the registry held no False
entry at all; the gate stood unmet, its named
remedy a rejection stream not yet run. This
filing lands the tracker's first grounded
False entries — two, each on receipts the
