Data and documentation under CC BY 4.0.
The suggested citations stand in the
repository: Althoff (2026), 'Artificial
Intelligence and Knowledge Production',
working paper; Alamos & Althoff (2026),
'SciNet: The Anatomy of Science' [dataset].
Funded by Stanford Impact Labs and
Anthropic, as the authors acknowledge.
Taken in as Paper 037: posted by Will in
the MOAT chat on 2026-11-24 as two links,
the site and the repository — a Will-
posted taking-in, outside the pre-
registered sample, which closed at Paper
036; no blind seal stands for it (the
P022 precedent for Will-posted works).
Will forked the repository the same day.
This chapter is the delta record: what
