(appendices included) on 2026-11-24.
Code is released at the authors'
repository (github.com/yingfan-bot/
lotus), unrun by the house.

THE RECIPE (the paper's Sections 2-3).
A looped padded Transformer processes
a padded latent prefix (1.2.590) — K
blocks of c latent tokens between the
question and the answer — under the
input-injected recurrence (1.2.594),
attending throughout to the question's
prefix cache, computed once. LOTUS
(1.2.588) supervises the post-loop
latents by step-aligned parallel
supervision (1.2.591) beside the answer
loss: the objective's two halves divide
as coverage and selection (1.2.593),
and the step loss optimizes a parallel
chain likelihood (1.2.592). LOTUS-aux
(1.2.595) routes the same supervision
through an auxiliary decoder instead;
the two routings want opposite
supervision readout schedules
(1.2.596).

THE STUDY (Sections 4-5). Trained on
GSM8k-Aug (385k examples; K = 6,
c = 25 on the Llama backbones and 13 on
GPT-2, R = 6, lambda_step = 0.05, 30
epochs) across GPT-2, Llama-3.2-1B and
Llama-3.2-3B. The headline is the
latent-explicit gap at scale (1.2.589)
closed: LOTUS tracks the explicit
ceiling at every size and passes it on
the 3B out-of-domain average, at 2.5x
lower thought latency in the
math-expression setting and 6.9x in the
natural-language stress test. The
ablations price the parts: no latent
supervision still beats the strongest
sequential baseline (63.3 against
62.3); accuracy climbs steeply in both
block width and loop depth to the
trained operating point; and the
checkpoint accepts inference-time
budget adaptation (1.2.599). The
analysis reads the trajectory back:
the gold-chain readout (1.2.597) and
mass on unseen valid chains (1.2.598),
with the two losses' roles confirmed by
their removal.

THE TWO STATE MACHINES the filing takes
from the work, both stated. (i) The
looped latent computation (its Section
3.2 and Figure 2): PREFIX (the question
encoded once; its KV cache C_pre
frozen for the run), ITERATE (the
latent grid refined by the
input-injected recurrence, t = 1..R,
every iteration attending to C_pre),
READOUT (the post-loop states tapped
twice — by the step loss through the LM
head, and inserted at the latent rows
of the final forward that the answer
loss scores). At inference the step
tap is removed and the machine's
terminal state is the answer decode,
autoregressive over the suffix alone.
(ii) The staged latent curriculum (its
Appendix D): STAGE (at epoch e, the
first K_e = min(floor(e/E_stage), K)
CoT steps stand as latent blocks and
the rest remain visible tokens, the
loop depth coupled to the width at
R_e = r * K_e; the machine begins as
ordinary CoT fine-tuning), SATURATE
(K_e = K and R = 6, the full latent
machine of the work's experiments).
