# 66.1.2 — State machines

(M1) THE RECURRENT-DEPTH FORWARD
MACHINE (the paper's Sections 3.1-3.2,
stated). States: the input embedding
e, fixed for the token; the latent
state s, drawn fresh for each token
from a scaled normal prior; a step
counter the machine itself never
reads. Transitions: EMBED — the
prelude (2 layers) maps the token
sequence to e; INIT — s_0 is sampled;
ITERATE — the shared core (4 layers)
is applied to the concatenation of s
and e, projected back by the adapter,
r times, e re-injected at every step;
READ — the coda (2 layers) and the
tied head turn the final state into a
distribution. Every intermediate state
can be sent through READ, which is
what makes the trajectory (1.2.524)
legible at all. The gap the machine
names: its depth is a free parameter
the machine does not set — r arrives
from outside, from training's
sampler, a caller's budget, or the
exit criterion of 1.2.653.

(M2) THE SAMPLED-DEPTH TRAINING
MACHINE (the paper's Sections 3.2 and
4.1, stated). States: one depth draw
per sequence; the unrolled forward
trajectory; a gradient that exists
only on the trajectory's tail.
Transitions: SAMPLE — r is drawn from
the log-normal Poisson law (1.2.649),
one draw locked across all workers
for the micro-batch; UNROLL — the
forward machine runs r iterations;
TRUNCATE — the backward pass flows
through only the last k = 8 iterations
(1.2.650); STEP — Adam updates every
weight, the prelude's through the
injected e at every step. The gap the
machine names: the gradient never
sees the early iterations it most
needs to shape — credit for the
trajectory's beginning arrives only
through the states the last k steps
inherit.
THE HOUSE CHECK — the paper's printed
arithmetic, recomputed (the checker's
script and its run record are kept
with the pass's papers). Forty-nine
checks; forty-six exact; three
tensions, all carried to 66.1.4 as
caveats. No claim of the filing's
rests on a tensioned figure, and no
False is filed.

VERIFIED EXACT, in the paper's own
figures: the architecture's arithmetic
— the effective depth at the headline
recurrence, 2 + 4 x 32 + 2 = 132,
printed in both Section 3.2's
unfolding and Section 4.1's
initialization; the 8 'real' layers
(2 + 4 + 2, read from the source's own
