Jonas Geiping, Sean McLeish, Neel
Jain, John Kirchenbauer, Siddharth
Singh, Brian R. Bartoldson, Bhavya
Kailkhura, Abhinav Bhatele and Tom
Goldstein, 'Scaling up Test-Time
Compute with Latent Reasoning: A
Recurrent Depth Approach',
arXiv:2502.05171v1 [cs.LG], 7 February
2025. Held text: the arXiv HTML of
v1, read entire (Sections 1-10,
references, appendices A-C), fetched
2026-11-24. Queue position: reference
frontier rank 13 (cited by Chapter
56's paper); the record carried the
identifier alone; no rank skipped in
the taking. Imports the filing stands
on: the deep-thinking line (Bansal et
al.; Schwarzschild et al.; Anil et
al.), from which the input injection,
the random initial state and path
independence descend; deep equilibrium
models (Bai et al.), the theory the
design imports and the training the
paper departs from; Takase et al.'s
