# Chapter 79 — Paper 061: Trusting Your Evidence (Shi, Han, Lewis, Tsvetkov, Zettlemoyer & Yih)

THE DELTA. Nine concepts
(1.2.791-1.2.799), one foundation laid
(1.3.377), no held concept revised,
no word coined: CLUSTER AT EXTENDED —
its fifteenth paper, and a new shape
of reference for the contrast line.
The work is the Washington–Meta
group's context-aware decoding of
2023: one model run twice per token,
with its context and without it, the
two logit streams combined as
(1 + α) times the first minus α times
the second, so the context's own
contribution to each token — its
pointwise mutual information with the
token (1.2.793) — is amplified and
the model's prior, modelled as the
withheld-context distribution
(1.2.792), is taxed. No training, no
second model: the reference that
contrastive decoding (1.2.525)
requires is manufactured by
withholding the evidence.

The book has carried this method's
name since the country's founding:
the canonical contrastive-decoding
scroll (1.2.525, Paper 038) lists 'a
perturbed prompt (context-aware
decoding)' among the known ways of
buying a weak reference, between the
second smaller model and DoLa's
intermediate layer. What the filing
adds is the device entire in its
first construction — the prior made
computable (1.2.792), the adjustment
level that prices it (1.2.794), the
cancellation that bounds it (1.2.795),
the conflict setting it was built for
(1.2.796) with its two instruments
(1.2.797, 1.2.798), and the premise
its title states and its mechanism
cannot check (1.2.799). Cluster J is
weighed at 79.2.2 and not joined: the
contrast steers the token; it renders
no verdict. The house check
recomputed the paper's printed
arithmetic (79.1.3): fourteen
declarations, fourteen exact — and
two of the paper's own prose
percentages fail against its tables,
carried at 79.1.4.

Its provenance: rank 25 of the
reference frontier built at leg 1 of
the network walk — cited by Chapter
56's paper (LoopCD) in its
bibliography — taken in as leg 22,
the walk's ninth pre-processed pass.
The queue record carried the
identifier entire: arXiv:2305.14739,
'Trusting Your Evidence: Hallucinate
Less with Context-aware Decoding' —
held entire in its v1 form (24 May
2023; the arXiv record carries no
later version; the venue's form is
NAACL 2024). The work is a network
taking-in outside the pre-registered
sample (closed at Paper 036); no
seal, no score.

Axis judgment: no axis event. The
paper works the country's founding
dimension — where a contrast finds
its reference — and moves it once
more, from the model's depths to its
input; the dimension itself is the
one the founding paper opened, and
the move is a new address on it, not
a new axis.

