# Chapter 80 — Paper 062: Stay on Topic with Classifier-Free Guidance (Sanchez, Fan, Spangher, Levi, Ammanamanchi & Biderman)

THE DELTA. Eight concepts
(1.2.800-1.2.807), one foundation
laid (1.3.378), no held concept
revised, no word coined: CLUSTER AT
EXTENDED — its sixteenth paper, and
the contrast line's ancestor-device,
filed sixth of its members and
first in the world's chronology.
The work is the EleutherAI-circle
collaboration of 2023 that carried
classifier-free guidance out of
text-to-image diffusion into pure
language modeling: one model run
under two conditionings — the
prompt, and the prompt dropped
(1.2.803) or replaced by a chosen
counter-prompt (1.2.802) — the two
logit streams combined so that what
the conditioning adds is amplified
by γ and what the model says
unconditioned is taxed (1.2.800).
No classifier is bought: by Bayes'
rule the model is its own
(1.2.801).

The book has lived inside this
device for two chapters without
filing it. The canonical
contrastive-decoding scroll
(1.2.525) has named it kin since
Paper 038; Chapter 77 filed a
concept inside it — the quality gap
inside CFG (1.2.780) — and measured
autoguidance against it; Chapter
79's context-aware decoding prints
its (1 + α) combination as a
sibling form. What this filing adds
is the device entire in its
language-model construction, with
the pieces the later members
presuppose: the implicit classifier
(1.2.801), the negative prompt
(1.2.802), the dropped prefix
(1.2.803), and the paper's own
measurements of what the device is
worth and what it costs — the
doubling exchange (1.2.804), the
validity–quality split (1.2.805),
the zeroed tail (1.2.806), and
entropy without instruction
(1.2.807). Cluster placement is
weighed at 80.2.2: AT extended
through the contrast line, its
seventh shape of reference; kinship
to AV recorded as kinship, the
device's native habitat being the
denoising trajectory; cluster J
weighed and not joined — the
combination steers the token and
renders no verdict. The house check
recomputed the paper's printed
arithmetic (80.1.3): eighteen
declarations, eighteen pass — and
the paper's code table prints a
third model size whose numbers are
its second size's, duplicated,
carried at 80.1.4.

Its provenance: rank 26 of the
reference frontier built at leg 1
of the network walk — cited by
Chapter 56's paper (LoopCD) in its
bibliography — taken in as leg 23,
the walk's tenth pre-processed
pass. The queue record carried the
identifier entire: arXiv:2306.17806,
'Stay on topic with Classifier-Free
Guidance' — held entire in its v1
form (30 Jun 2023; the arXiv record
carries no later version; the
venue's form is ICML 2024, whose
byline as rendered names five
authors, a difference recorded at
80.3.1). The work is a network
taking-in outside the pre-registered
sample (closed at Paper 036); no
seal, no score.

Axis judgment: no axis event. The
paper works the country's founding
dimension — where a contrast finds
its reference — and answers it with
the oldest answer the line owns:
the same model, its conditioning
removed. In the world's order that
answer precedes every other member
of the line; the dimension itself
is the founding paper's, and an
imported root is not a new axis.

