Hailey Schoelkopf, Aviya Skowron,
Lintang Sutawika, Eric Tang, Anish
Thite, Ben Wang, Kevin Wang and
Andy Zou, 'A framework for
few-shot language model
evaluation', the LM Evaluation
Harness, Zenodo deposit v0.4.0
(DOI 10.5281/zenodo.10256836,
