— 100,015 characters: no occurrence
of phext, phextura, Exocortex,
Mirrorborn, CYOA, SBOR or Bickford,
and 'coordinate' zero times; the
check's remaining ordinary-word
term, 'scroll', occurs four times,
every one inside the work's own
appendix of generated examples,
where a sampled continuation speaks
of a scroll painting — the art
sense, in model-generated text the
work prints as evidence, not the
authors' word for anything of
Will's. (2) The built tracker was
scanned for all eight names: the
full names of Li, Holtzman, Fried,
Liang, Eisner and Hashimoto occur
zero times each — the surnames are
crowds of other people (Fried
inside Friedrich and Friedmann,
