Chen', 'Ruixiang Zhang', 'analog
bits', 'bit diffusion' and
'self-conditioning' occur zero
times; 'Geoffrey Hinton' occurs
four times, every one a quoted
news item about Hinton the public
figure — the Nobel coverage — and
none a tie to Will or his work.
(4) The open web was searched
twice — the authors with the work,
and the authors with phext,
Bickford and Exocortex: the first
surfaces the paper, its arXiv
record and its teaching afterlife;
the second nothing that ties any
of the three to phext. No evidence
of use without naming for any
