# 90.2.1 — Synthesis: the key that teaches a judge

[synthesis] The work's move is to
split the solver in two and train
the second half to judge the
first. Generation had been priced
by counting (1.2.855): draw many,
and an oracle's pick among them
is worth orders of magnitude.
This work asks what the oracle
costs to approximate, and answers
with a training run: sample the
solver against a table whose key
is worked (1.2.868), label the
samples by their answers alone
(1.2.872), and fit a judge to the
labels (1.2.869). The selection
that spends the judge (1.2.870)
then cashes a real share of the
counted oracle's value — a small
generator judged well stands
where a giant guessing once
stands — and the work is honest
about the exchange rate's limit:
search past a few hundred
candidates and the judge, not the
solver, becomes the binding
constraint, its error surface
mined by the very search it
guides.

Read against the book, the
chapter is the examination
country growing an organ it did
not have. The country's tables
had keys and graders; this one
trains a grader into a model and
hands it to the solver at test
time, so the examination's
standard leaves the examination
and rides along with the examined.
It is also the book's clearest
early statement that judgment is
cheaper than generation — that a
model too small to solve a
problem reliably can still be
taught to know a solution when it
sees one, and that the knowing,
spent on selection, is worth more
than the solving it replaces. The
costs are filed with it: the
judge learns from labels that
bless lucky reasoning, the
generator's breadth is spent by
the training that sharpens it
(1.2.873), and the judge's finest
instrument — a verdict at every
token (1.2.871) — is built,
measured, and left unspent, the
chapter's loose thread carried as
Q323.
# 90.2.2 — Cluster placement

AY EXTENDED — the cluster's
eighth paper. The extension is
made on the country's own
definition, as the seven before
it were: a fixed table of
problems and verdicts, published
as data and judging every work
that reports against it. This
work's deliverable is exactly
such an artifact, with a key of a
new kind: GSM8K's verdicts are
worked solutions (1.2.868), the
reasoning published with the
answers. The work built on the
table files here entire, judge
included, on the country's own
precedent: the grader of Chapter
83 and the audits of Chapter 84
are residents of the country
whose table they serve, and this
verifier is trained from this
table's labels, validated on this
table's test split, and worthless
without it. What the eighth
resident adds is the country's
first judge that is a model: the
trained verifier (1.2.869), the
ranked selection that spends it
(1.2.870), the token-level judge
(1.2.871), the answer-only label
it was trained on (1.2.872), the
coverage collapse its generator
suffers (1.2.873) and the
calculator annotation inside its
key (1.2.874). The infrastructure
founding deferred at Chapter 83
and declined at Chapters 84, 88
and 89 was reweighed under its
restated condition — a work whose
center of mass is apparatus
itself, no table of its own — and
declined a fifth time: this work
has a table, and its apparatus is
the table's instrument; the
condition is not met.

Cluster J was weighed a
nineteenth time, at length, and
not joined. The work holds three
spendings of verdicts, and each
misses the standing condition —
a mechanism consulting a
reference distinct from the
judged object, for a verdict
whose evidence lies beyond it,
spent inside the judged
computation (62.2.2, 68.2.2) — at
a different clause. The training
labels consult the key entire,
evidence beyond the judged object
entire, but they are spent on the
judge's own training, one stage
up and one run earlier: Chapter
88's teacher form, at the second
remove — they build the
instrument that will judge; they
judge nothing. The ranked
selection is the nearest miss the
book has filed: the verdict is
spent inside the test-time
episode, on the very problem
under judgment, deciding what the
procedure returns — but each
judged computation, a single
completion's generation, runs
entire before any verdict on it
exists, and no verdict enters any
generation. Under Chapter 84's
narrowing the locus carries the
boundary, and selection among
finished candidates is the
evaluation's computation, not the
judged one — Chapter 84's oracle
with a learned judge in the
oracle's chair. One clause more
has thinned: at the moment of
judgment the trained verifier
consults no reference at all —
the key survives in it as
weights, so the reference is
present in the judge's person and
absent from its evidence; the
distinctness the condition asks
for is met by the judge's
separateness from the generator
and missed by its reading, which
is the judged object alone. And
the token-level judge is the
weighing's sharpest edge: a
verdict read after every token of
the judged object, the only
verdict-form in the book that
runs along the judged
computation's own length — and it
is never spent. It guides
nothing, prunes nothing, stops
nothing; the selection reads only
the finished solution's standing.
A verdict computed inside the run
and spent after it is a verdict
spent after it. The weighing
testifies on Q288 as narrowed at
Chapter 84: the boundary holds at
the locus even when the judge is
learned, the episode is single,
and the verdict's form runs the
judged object's full length — and
it names the crossing's exact
shape, carried as Q323: spend the
running verdict inside a
generation, and this family's own
instrument joins on the spot.
1.2.716 remains cluster J's only
resident.

The rest of the map, briefly. O,
the pricing of judges: held apart
— this work builds a judge and
spends it; pricing judges is an
act performed on works like this
one, not by them. AT: no
trajectory is travelled, recurred
or contrasted; sampling is
repeated trial under a verdict,
not a path. AV: nothing is
denoised and nothing steered. AX:
weighed and held apart — the
calculator annotations are
strings that run, but they are
the generator's prosthesis inside
natural-language solutions,
scaffolding for arithmetic; the
work's mathematics is word
problems in prose, not
mathematics presented as strings.
AZ: no family reports itself; one
laboratory's models are examined
and judged, not chronicled.
