# 91.2.1 — Synthesis: the whole curriculum, sat unprepared

[synthesis] The work's move is to
widen the examination until it
covers the curriculum entire, and
then to refuse the examined any
preparation for it. A test built
from the tests — school, college,
the professions' own licensing —
administered zero-shot and
few-shot to models whose whole
education was the open internet:
what it returns is not a ranking
of solvers but a map of what
pretraining actually deposited,
subject by subject. And the map
is the finding. The deposits are
lopsided (1.2.877), absent
outright below a scale threshold
(1.2.878), and everywhere short
of the standard the certifying
world sets its own best sitters
(1.2.879) — breadth without
mastery, in the work's own
summary: some knowledge of many
things, expertise in none.

Read against the book, the
chapter is the examination
country completing its own shape.
Its residents before this were
single-domain tables and their
instruments — a contest, an
olympiad, a coding set, a
word-problem set, a grader, an
audit. This one contains their
domains as subjects among
fifty-seven, and it became, in
the field beyond the book, the
table other works report against
as a matter of course: the common
measure the country had been
missing. It is also the country's
most self-suspicious instrument.
It prices its examined's
self-knowledge alongside its
knowledge and finds the second
wanting (1.2.880); it audits its
own key against the examined's
memory and certifies itself clean
from the pattern of its scores
(1.2.881). Its loose threads are
filed with it: a total that
claims four questions its splits
cannot produce (91.1.4), an
expert line built from other
examinations' percentiles, and
the four questions it opens —
Q327 on the floor's shape, Q328
on the unspent self-verdict, Q329
on the unaudited key, Q330 on the
inverted order.
# 91.2.2 — Cluster placement

AY EXTENDED — the cluster's ninth
paper. The extension is made on
the country's own definition, as
the eight before it were: a fixed
table of problems and verdicts,
published as data and judging
every work that reports against
it. This work's deliverable is
exactly such an artifact, and the
broadest the country holds:
fifty-seven subjects in one
instrument (1.2.875), where the
residents before it were single
domains — a table transcribed, a
contest's two years, an olympiad
bench, a grader alone, a table
audited, a coding set, a
synthesis set, and a table whose
key is worked. What the ninth
resident adds is the union table
and its instruments: the
pretraining examination
(1.2.876), the lopsided profile
(1.2.877), the chance floor
(1.2.878), the expert line
(1.2.879), the unknowing examined
(1.2.880) and the contamination
audit (1.2.881); no foundation is
laid and no held concept is
revised. The infrastructure
founding deferred at Chapter 83
and declined at Chapters 84, 88,
89 and 90 was reweighed under its
restated condition — a work whose
center of mass is apparatus
itself, no table of its own — and
declined a sixth time: this work
ships a dataset and code, but its
center of mass is the table
entire, and its apparatus is a
prompt template and an argmax
over four tokens; the condition
is not met.

Cluster J was weighed a twentieth
time, at length, and not joined.
The work holds four candidate
spendings of verdicts, and each
misses the standing condition — a
mechanism consulting a reference
distinct from the judged object,
for a verdict whose evidence lies
beyond it, spent inside the
judged computation (62.2.2,
68.2.2) — at a different clause.
The scoring argmax consults no
reference at all: the examined's
own label probabilities grade the
examined, spent at grading, after
the run — the shape the boundary
has declined since the country's
founding papers. The few-shot
prompt puts a reference in the
room — five answered examples of
the subject precede every
question — but it is spent as
steering before the run, not as a
verdict inside it: 77.2.2's line,
held again. The calibration
reading (1.2.880) compares the
model's confidence against its
accuracy, but the comparison is
the examiners' analysis,
performed on the work afterward
and spent in no computation at
all. And the contamination audit
(1.2.881) consults the examined's
memory as its reference, but its
verdict is spent on the table's
own standing, not inside any
judged run. The weighing
testifies on Q288 as narrowed at
Chapter 84: the boundary holds at
the locus even when the reference
sits inside the prompt and the
verdict is the examined's own
confidence — and Q323's shape,
spend the running verdict inside
a generation, is untouched by
anything here. 1.2.716 remains
cluster J's only resident.

The rest of the map, briefly. O,
the pricing of judges: held apart
— this work measures models
against a line; its calibration
reading prices the examined's
self-knowledge, not a judge. AT:
no trajectory is travelled,
recurred or contrasted. AV:
nothing is denoised; the few-shot
prompt conditions the examined
but guides no sampling process.
AX: no mathematics is presented
as strings; the table's questions
are prose. AZ: no family reports
itself; several laboratories'
models are examined, none
chronicled.
