(1.2.496), the standard parabolic
setting (1.2.497), the Casselman-Jacquet
functor's exactness (1.2.935) — and the
author is the founding paper's co-
author. Chapter 54 filed the comparison
the distributions serve; Chapter 100
filed the functor; this chapter files
the distributions themselves, on the
flag variety the other two share.

NO HELD CONCEPT IS REVISED. The
candidates were 1.2.505, the smooth
Bruhat filtration, and 1.2.508, the
orbit comparison — Paper 036's claims
about Lie-algebra homology on orbits.
Weighed against Paper 080's revision of
