CLUSTER J IS WEIGHED A THIRTIETH TIME
AND NOT JOINED. The work contains no
mechanism that consults a reference
distinct from the judged object, for a
verdict spent inside the computation:
its pairings evaluate the distribution
itself, and its theorems are proved, not
