# Chapter 106 — Paper 088: Unitary representations and complex analysis (Vogan)

David A. Vogan Jr. (Department of
Mathematics, Massachusetts Institute
of Technology, Cambridge,
Massachusetts), 'Unitary
representations and complex analysis',
in Representation Theory and Complex
Analysis, Lecture Notes in Math. 1931,
Springer, Berlin, 2008, pp. 259-344 —
the version of record is the author's
final version of 2 January 2008, held
from the author's own MIT papers page,
where the author describes it in his
