(charter rule 9): William Casselman —
True +1, Unknown +15 (eleven
concepts, four questions); Henryk
Hecht — True +1, Unknown +15 (eleven
concepts, four questions); Dragan
Milicic — True +1, Unknown +15
(eleven concepts, four questions).
# 107.1.6 — Author check #97: Casselman, Hecht and Milicic against the record

