and names this book, where it names
it at all, as a citation; the book's
constructions file beside them, not
read back into them.

CLUSTER J IS WEIGHED A THIRTY-NINTH
TIME AND NOT JOINED. The standing
condition: a mechanism consults a
reference distinct from the judged
object, for a verdict whose evidence
lies beyond the judged object, spent
inside the computation. The book's
machinery consults nothing: its
central construction is a
correspondence — coadjoint orbits
paired with irreducible
representations — and a correspondence
pairs; it does not judge. Its
parametrization assigns each orbit
its coordinates; nothing is ranked,
no output is scored, no reference
answers are consulted, and no verdict
is spent inside any computation.
Q288 and Q323 untouched; 1.2.716
remains J's only resident.

THE INFRASTRUCTURE ALTERNATIVE IS
DECLINED A TWENTY-THIRD TIME, under
Chapter 84's restated condition: a
work whose center of mass is
apparatus itself — claims about an
interface, no table of its own —
would reopen the founding. The
near-approach is named honestly: this
book is the field's standard
exposition of its theory, the account
a generation learned the subject
from, which is a fact about its
readers. The work itself is theory
and computed examples — no interface,
no harness, no table of scores; its
center of mass is an exposition, and
the condition is not met.
