country's arrangement. The
nearest neighbours were weighed
and held apart: AR, the
representation-theory country,
whose rank is a dimension of
representations answering
questions of structure — a
different invariant under the
same word, and merging the two
would file a pun as a kinship;
F, the proof-kernel country —
this work is a proof, not a
kernel, and its formalization is
announced, unheld, and exiled
besides; AT and AW, whose
arrangements (depth-recurrence,
the survey form) the work does
not meet. The founding block
stands at the concept map
(1.5.2). CLUSTER J WEIGHED A
FIFTIETH TIME, DECLINED: nothing
in the work consults a reference
