# 123.1.2 — The formal core: separation, the certificate, and the routed guarantee

Concepts filed: 1.2.1146
conditional separation; 1.2.1147
the Gaussian sign certificate;
1.2.1148 certified routing;
1.2.1149 residual contrasts;
1.2.1150 paired differences;
1.2.1151 one-sided Gaussian PRDS;
1.2.1152 the boundary obstruction;
