Cluster O is extended, not joined
by a neighbour and not founded
anew: the paper's ten concepts
stand inside O's held ground
(statistics: judging and testing
from data), extending the BH/FDR
line Papers 024 and 026 laid down.
No cluster is founded. Links
counted at the delta: 12 internal
— 1146 to 1147 and 1148; 1147 to
